  "image": "data:image/jpeg;base64,",
  "instructions": "- Mix spice blend into blender. Add more vegetable broth or water if needed. Blend. Pour into 12 x 1 Cup silicon molds.\n- Cook Quinoa in rice-cooker in vegetable broth. Put in blender and blend in water or additional vegetable broth. Pour blended quinoa into 12 x 1 Cup silicon molds (over top the spice blend)\n- Add frozen molds, tofu, and vegetables to sandwich bags. I recommend freezing and thawing tofu, then squeezing out water before adding to soup mix.\n- When cooking, cook in microwave for 6 mins without water to thaw out. Mash up ingredients and add water, then cook for additional 6 minutes. Add extra frozen kale to get down to temperature quickly.",
